  m_Text: 'Get ready for an exciting adventure in Aviator: Rising Stars. In this
    exciting game, the player will have to go through a triathlon, using various
    vehicles to overcome various obstacles and collect stars, symbolizing points.



    The
    player will have to control various types of transport, such as a car, plane,
    boat, in order to travel as far as possible. At the same time, the player must
    collect stars to score maximum points.



    However, the player should be careful:
    he must change vehicles in time to avoid losing, and also skillfully avoid obstacles
    and obstacles so as not to lose points. By falling or colliding with an obstacle,
    the player risks losing, so he needs to be alert and keep his attention to the
    maximum.'
